# Google Sign-In via Google Identity Services.
# This is a PUBLIC OAuth client ID (safe to expose in the browser) — not a secret.
#
# To create one:
#   1. https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials  →  Create credentials  →  OAuth client ID
#   2. Application type: Web application
#   3. Authorized JavaScript origins: add  http://localhost:5173  (and your deployed origin)
#   4. Copy the "Client ID" (ends in .apps.googleusercontent.com) into web/.env.local
#
# Leave unset to disable Google sign-in — the email option still works.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
